输入长度，本地攻击者可通过设置超长 DISPLAY 环境变量触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 jaZip 0.32-2 及可能更早版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0110"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:40Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 jaZip 至 Debian DSA-017 公告中提供的修复版本，或通过 apt-get upgrade jaZip 获取补丁。由于该软件年代久远已停止维护，如无法升级应彻底卸载 jaZip（apt-get remove jaZip）并移除其 setuid 权限位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/jazip），同时限制本地用户环境变量长度以防止利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0228.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-017","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2209","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5942","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/257","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0110.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0110.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0110","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0110.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0110.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e9abd745a1d6114f0fa7d3f67607c023bdf3fa37/2001/CVE-2001-0110.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0110.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0110.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0110.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0110.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0045.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0044","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0044.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0109","title":"SuSE Linux rctab 临时文件符号链接竞争条件漏洞","description":"SuSE Linux 6.x 及 7.0 系统中的 rctab 工具存在竞争条件漏洞。rctab 在处理临时文件 rctmp 时未进行安全的原子操作，本地攻击者可通过符号链接攻击（symlink attack）在 rctab 创建临时文件前预先创建指向目标文件的符号链接，从而利用该竞争条件覆盖或创建系统任意文件，导致本地权限提升或系统文件被篡改。攻击者需要本地访问权限且利用复杂度较高，CVSS 评分 1.2。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0109"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:40Z","remediation":"升级 SuSE Linux 至 7.0 以上版本，或移除 rctab 的 setuid 权限并限制仅 root 用户可执行。如无法升级，删除 rctab 工具或通过 chmod 移除其 suid 位以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0226.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0272.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2207","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5945","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20555","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0109.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0109.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0109","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0109.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0109.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e9abd745a1d6114f0fa7d3f67607c023bdf3fa37/2001/CVE-2001-0109.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0109.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0109.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0109.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0109.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0044.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0668","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0668.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0047","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 MTS包管理注册表权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 的 MTS 包管理注册表项默认权限设置不当，本地用户可通过修改注册表键值安装或篡改任意 Microsoft Transaction Server (MTS) 包，从而提升权限至系统级。攻击者需拥有本地登录权限，利用该漏洞可完全控制系统。Microsoft 尚未发布针对该旧版本系统的安全更新。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0047"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:33Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 6a 及后续安全更新，或通过 Windows Update 安装 2001 年 2 月安全更新补丁。如无法安装补丁，可限制对注册表项 HKLM\\Software\\Microsoft\\TransactionServer 的写入权限，仅允许管理员组访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2065","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-095","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5673","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A140","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0047.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0047.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0047","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0047.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0047.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c3d516d6bc446725f6492ed800c677df20d0d39c/2001/CVE-2001-0047.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0047.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0047.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0047.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0047.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0668.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0615","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0615.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0092","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 跨域框架验证绕过漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 5.0 至 5.5 版本中存在框架域名验证漏洞（Frame Domain Verification），浏览器窗口内用于验证框架来源域名的函数未能正确执行跨域检查，导致远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意框架的网页，诱使目标用户使用受影响的 IE 浏览器访问后，绕过同源策略限制，跨域读取客户端本地文件系统中的敏感信息。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高，需要用户交互配合，仅影响机密性，不造成数据篡改或服务中断。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0092"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:38Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-093 对应的补丁程序，或升级 Internet Explorer 至 6.0 及以上版本。如无法升级，可在 Internet 区域中禁用「启用跨框架浏览子域」选项，并将受信任站点区域设置为高安全级别以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/7817","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-093","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6086","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0092.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0092.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0092","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0092.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0092.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/debb5b9043b725433d6b6e41048f63a9bcce2f7e/2001/CVE-2001-0092.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0092.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0092.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0092.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0092.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0615.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0614","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0614.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0091","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer Scriptlet ActiveX 控件任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 5.0 至 5.5 版本中用于调用脚本小程序（Scriptlet）的 ActiveX 控件存在任意文件读取漏洞。当用户访问攻击者精心构造的恶意网页时，该控件会错误地将任意类型的文件内容渲染为 HTML 页面，而非仅处理预期的 HTML 文件，导致攻击者能够跨域读取目标系统上的任意文件内容。攻击条件要求用户使用受影响的 IE 浏览器访问恶意网站，且需诱使用户交互触发脚本执行。该漏洞可导致敏感信息泄露，影响 Windows 平台上 IE 5.0 至 5.5 版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0091"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:38Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-093 提供的补丁，该补丁随 IE 5.5 Service Pack 2 或 IE 5.01 Service Pack 2 发布。如无法升级，可在 IE 安全设置中将 Internet 区域脚本功能禁用，并将 ActiveX 控件中\"对未标记为可安全执行脚本的 ActiveX 控件初始化并执行脚本\"设为禁用。建议升级至更高版本 IE 或更换现代浏览器以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/7820","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-093","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6085","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0091.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0091.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0091","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0091.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0091.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08861b52e373e5d8411b1b6670fe650ef2757f4b/2001/CVE-2001-0091.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0091.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0091.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0091.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0091.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0614.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0613","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0613.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0090","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.5 浏览器打印模板远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 5.5 的打印模板（Print Templates）功能存在安全漏洞，当用户浏览恶意网页时，攻击者可利用该功能在未经用户提示的情况下执行任意自定义打印模板，进而调用任意 ActiveX 控件。攻击者需诱导用户访问特制网页，利用该漏洞可在用户浏览器上下文中执行任意代码，导致信息泄露、系统篡改或进一步攻击。该漏洞影响 Internet Explorer 5.5 版本，CVSS 评分 5.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0090"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:38Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-093 提供的补丁，该补丁适用于 Internet Explorer 5.5。如无法安装补丁，可将 IE 升级至 5.5 SP1 或 5.01 SP2 版本。临时缓解措施：在 Internet 安全区域中将 ActiveX 控件和脚本设置为禁用，或使用组策略限制打印模板功能的执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2046","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-093","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5614","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0090.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0090.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0090","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0090.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0090.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0090.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08861b52e373e5d8411b1b6670fe650ef2757f4b/2001/CVE-2001-0090.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0090.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0090.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0090.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0613.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0612","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0612.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0088","title":"phpWebLog 管理员认证绕过漏洞","description":"phpWebLog 0.4.2 的 common.inc.php 文件未正确初始化 $CONF 数组，导致系统将管理员密码意外设置为单个字符，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过暴力猜测 SiteKey 绕过管理员认证机制，获取 phpWebLog 后台完全管理权限。该漏洞影响 phpWebLog 0.4.2 及可能更早版本，攻击复杂度低，仅需网络访问即可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0088"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:38Z","remediation":"立即将 phpWebLog 升级至 0.4.3 或更高版本，该版本已修复 common.inc.php 中 $CONF 数组未正确初始化导致密码被设为单字符的问题。如已无法获取更新版本，建议迁移至其他受支持的 Web 日志系统（如 WordPress），并在迁移前严格限制对 phpWebLog 管理后台的访问 IP 范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0025.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2047","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5625","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0088.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0088.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0088","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0088.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0088.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0088.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8eb5179bc94e368fed99f8f208b080aa4b8a56b8/2001/CVE-2001-0088.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0088.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0088.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0088.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0612.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0612.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0612.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0609","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0609.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0045","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 注册表权限远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 系统中，RAS Administration 注册表项的默认权限配置不当，允许本地用户修改该注册表键值并将其指向恶意的 DLL 文件。当系统或相关服务尝试加载此 DLL 时，将在受影响系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 版本，攻击者需具备目标系统的本地访问权限。利用方式上，攻击者可将 RAS Administration 注册表项的值修改为指向自己控制的恶意 DLL 路径，从而在系统加载该组件时触发代码执行，进而完全掌控目标系统。该漏洞属于注册表权限配置类安全缺陷，CVSS 评分高达 10 分，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0045"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:33Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-095 发布的注册表权限修复工具（regacl40），该工具可将 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\RAS 注册表项的默认权限修改为仅允许 Administrators、System 和 Creator Owner 完全控制，从而阻止普通用户修改 RAS Administration 键值指向恶意 DLL。可从 Microsoft Download Center（FamilyID=8E7C68EE-98BC-440E-A99D-6A97308FDCB0）下载对应 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 5 或 6a 版本的工具，运行命令为 regacl40，或使用 regedt32 手动删除 Everyone 对该键的写权限。如系统未安装 RAS 服务，可通过控制面板移除远程访问服务作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2064","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-095","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5671","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A500","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a64d14d4e99e9e15688962dcc640f9e44c67eb2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0045.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d547588420a9a1d22d6d9d3bde1463155fe33c31/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0045.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0045","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0045.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0045.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b290a4630bf00bc86efda07bc07c03b933274d3f/2001/CVE-2001-0045.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8aab22d02785f79271894073fc1a1d558c4aae6b/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0045.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0045.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0045.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0045.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0609.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0608","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0608.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0043","title":"phpGroupWare 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"phpGroupWare 在 0.9.7 及之前版本中存在远程代码执行漏洞，其 phpgw.inc.php 程序未对 phpgw_info 参数进行严格校验，导致远程攻击者可通过构造恶意包含文件路径的方式，将任意 PHP 文件引入并执行。该漏洞影响部署了受影响版本 phpGroupWare 的 Web 服务器，攻击者无需身份认证即可在目标服务器上执行任意 PHP 代码，完全控制服务器及数据。由于涉及文件包含与远程代码执行，该漏洞 CVSS 评分为满分 10.0，危害等级为严重。建议将 phpGroupWare 升级至 0.9.7 或更高版本以修复该漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0043"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:32Z","remediation":"将 phpGroupWare 升级至 0.9.7 或更高版本，该版本已修复 phpgw.inc.php 中 phpgw_info 参数的远程文件包含漏洞。如暂无法升级，可在 Web 服务器层对 phpgw.inc.php 的 phpgw_info 参数进行输入过滤，禁止包含外部 URL，并限制该文件的直接访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0053.html","http://sourceforge.net/project/shownotes.php?release_id=17604","http://www.osvdb.org/1682","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2069","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5650","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/46b010b6722307e014d6f10d53a573bb1f6478ce/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0043.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0043.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0043","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0043.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0043.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d5efef4fd74ef7181076173af290c3cdae5dbeb5/2001/CVE-2001-0043.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8aab22d02785f79271894073fc1a1d558c4aae6b/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0043.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0043.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0043.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2001-0043.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0608.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0608.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0591","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0591.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0058","title":"Cisco CBOS Web 接口拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco 600 系列路由器上运行的 CBOS 2.4.1 及更早版本的 Web 管理接口存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过向目标设备发送一个末尾不含空格字符的特制 URL 请求触发拒绝服务，导致设备无法正常响应。该漏洞影响 Cisco 600 系列路由器，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。目前官方已发布修复建议，建议用户升级至 CBOS 2.4.2 或更高版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0058"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:34Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco 600 系列路由器 CBOS 至 2.4.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 URL 解析异常导致的拒绝服务问题。如无法立即升级，可在路由器访问控制列表（ACL）中限制对 Web 管理界面的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任的管理地址连接，降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/CBOS-multiple.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/460","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5626","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2001/CVE-2001-0058.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0058.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0058.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0058","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0058.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0058.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0058.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2001/CVE-2001-0058.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/20ec019115a0b1de7bc97fc35bb5f73fa34a0aae/2001/CVE-2001-0058.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0058.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0591.toml"}]